  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/19b68db6-6786-48d8-8909-72530f14bd09.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 160px;\" /></p><p>From the figure, in right-angled <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>,</mo></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>75</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfrac><mi>h</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mn>75</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mn>75</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math><br />In right-angled <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>,</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />From <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> we get,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mn>75</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;meters</p>",
